// One parameter of a merged function. A position the mask flags `1` is a whole
// number (`word lv3`); one flagged `2` is a float string (`string lvs3`). The two
// kinds get different name stems because id gives one name one type across the
// whole program.

mg_name_at(string mgflag, int mgk) {
  string mgr = "word " + (import mgzp)[1] + mgk;
  if(mgflag == "2") {
    mgr = "string " + (import mgzp)[1] + "s" + mgk;
  }
} return string mgr;
given mg_setup given mg_setup_c ("1", 3):("word lv3")
given mg_setup given mg_setup_c ("2", 3):("string lvs3")
